{"id":"dads-big-snore","title":"Dad's Big Snore","level":3,"series":"Dash Adventures","cover":{"h":"0789090b39532fd67d34b23d95b95d9e","t":"image/webp"},"titleAudio":null,"cast":[{"role":"hero","name":"Logan","portrait":{"h":"cf541143e9c73f6a4921ebd5175623cb","t":"image/webp"}},{"role":"sister","name":"Anastasia","portrait":{"h":"4b8a1a7bc845473e95a93b7d3c7d3a7d","t":"image/webp"}},{"role":"dad","name":"Dad","portrait":{"h":"4a3effd5da379d9c095d2ece4f986c49","t":"image/webp"}},{"role":"mum","name":"Mum","portrait":{"h":"4e8d5c2035e2129d567a2a2bbf62e944","t":"image/webp"}},{"role":"dash","name":"Dash","portrait":{"h":"5394e0f1443cd76f83368aaf141c3340","t":"image/webp"}}],"mystery":null,"practise":["loud","round","mouth","away","dream","cries"],"common":["so","like","she","all","they","puts"],"challenge":["snore","snores","snoring","asleep","curtains"],"before":"Does anyone in your house snore? What does it sound like?","after":["Why did the toys float round the room?","What did Logan try first? Did it work?","How did Mum stop the snoring?","Who was snoring at the end?"],"retell":[2,4,5,9,11,14],"pages":[{"text":"It is night. Dad is fast asleep.","bubble":null,"image":{"h":"b74ba883ed11c50f44e13a0381a0f066","t":"image/webp"},"alt":"A cosy bedroom at night with moonlight through the curtains.","audio":{"text":null,"bubble":null}},{"text":"Then Dad snores. It is so loud!","bubble":null,"image":{"h":"09474597da7b2a11898c595032cb6ddf","t":"image/webp"},"alt":"Dad snores and a big wavy swirl of sound rolls out of his mouth across the room.","audio":{"text":null,"bubble":null}},{"text":"The curtains flap like a sail.","bubble":null,"image":{"h":"7ad9c984009b8aec29dd11ae3ed904f8","t":"image/webp"},"alt":"The bedroom curtains billow out like the sails of a ship in the gust of Dad's snore.","audio":{"text":null,"bubble":null}},{"text":"Dash shoots up into the air!","bubble":null,"image":{"h":"8a89c5d0b4df85ce6bb47aed7e05e320","t":"image/webp"},"alt":"Dash is blasted out of his basket, flying up into the air with his blanket flapping behind him like a cape.","audio":{"text":null,"bubble":null}},{"text":"Books and socks float round and round the room.","bubble":null,"image":{"h":"8c0cdfbc13e401d11d0a63acc8b8c6ba","t":"image/webp"},"alt":"In the children's bedroom next door, books, socks, teddy bears and toy cars swirl round and round the room.","audio":{"text":null,"bubble":null}},{"text":"Logan and Anastasia hang on to the bed.","bubble":null,"image":{"h":"797751c4aab839e36e25c8c6d819c785","t":"image/webp"},"alt":"Logan and Anastasia cling to the bedposts, blown sideways like flags, pyjamas flapping.","audio":{"text":null,"bubble":null}},{"text":"Anastasia cries out.","bubble":{"who":"sister","name":"Anastasia","text":"We need a plan!","side":"left"},"image":{"h":"3fb7153de62a758f043d66509a3611e8","t":"image/webp"},"alt":"On the landing, Anastasia points at Dad's bedroom door with a determined face.","audio":{"text":null,"bubble":null}},{"text":"Logan puts a sock on Dad's mouth.","bubble":null,"image":{"h":"98b14a914d1e0fc83a85997f21073a4e","t":"image/webp"},"alt":"Logan tiptoes to Dad's bedside and gently lays a stripy sock over Dad's mouth.","audio":{"text":null,"bubble":null}},{"text":"SNORE! The sock shoots away like a rocket.","bubble":null,"image":{"h":"e4f664f56ebf30941134b850f4297911","t":"image/webp"},"alt":"The sock blasts off from Dad's mouth like a rocket with a swirly trail, past the ceiling light.","audio":{"text":null,"bubble":null}},{"text":"Then Mum sits up. She has a plan too.","bubble":null,"image":{"h":"0284da1cc20bcddf269cf2e2ad83e87c","t":"image/webp"},"alt":"Mum pushes her eye mask up onto her forehead with a clever, knowing smile and one finger raised.","audio":{"text":null,"bubble":null}},{"text":"Mum sings a soft song in Dad's ear.","bubble":null,"image":{"h":"607c2fa6074aca383e0e4d21437d56d8","t":"image/webp"},"alt":"Mum leans over and sings softly into Dad's ear.","audio":{"text":null,"bubble":null}},{"text":"Dad stops snoring. He grins in his dream.","bubble":null,"image":{"h":"b911f7de60c2a2cae94759b77b9afe69","t":"image/webp"},"alt":"Dad sleeps peacefully, grinning.","audio":{"text":null,"bubble":null}},{"text":"At last, all is still. They creep back to bed.","bubble":null,"image":{"h":"02c228f20edf49984a7cfcb805e98101","t":"image/webp"},"alt":"The toys float gently back down.","audio":{"text":null,"bubble":null}},{"text":"But then... SNORE! Now Mum is snoring!","bubble":null,"image":{"h":"9efd49235d78e0dc9e31b552e5e34be9","t":"image/webp"},"alt":"Mum is asleep and snoring a whistling snore that blows Dad's hair about.","audio":{"text":null,"bubble":null}}],"words":{}}